<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: teleporter links</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Open the route to the power switch and activate it. At each of the three teleporters, start linking and return to the mainframe at spawn within the displayed time.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Link all three to open Pack-a-Punch. Upgrade a weapon before starting Fly Trap.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-flytrap">Fly Trap and Annihilator</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-flytrap-1" data-guide-step>From the starting area, use a Pack-a-Punched weapon to shoot the control panel outside the map and start the Fly Trap audio.</li>
<li id="guide-step-flytrap-2" data-guide-step>Find and shoot the three hidden toy targets: the furnace area, the teleporter-side vat area and the elevated exterior ledge. Use the source images for the precise sightlines.</li>
<li id="guide-step-flytrap-3" data-guide-step>After the final confirmation, collect the Annihilator from its furnace reward location.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-perk">Hidden perk</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-perk-1" data-guide-step>Obtain Monkey Bombs and use them for the three teleporter interactions. Complete the associated control activations.</li>
